  "body": "CCC & Title issued, ready to move in!\r\n\r\nA spacious, brand-new family home in a prime East Auckland location — stylish, practical, and ready to move in. Choose from four thoughtfully designed freestanding, freehold homes, all featuring multiple ensuites, modern layouts, and quality finishes, perfectly suited to a variety of family needs.\r\n\r\nLot1: 4 Bedrooms (including 2 Ensuites) |  171m² Floor Area (MOL) | 202m² Freehold Section (MOL) \r\nLot2: 4 Bedrooms (including 2 Ensuites) | 168  m² Floor Area (MOL) | 162 m² Freehold Section (MOL) \r\nLot3: 4 Bedrooms (including 2 Ensuites) |168  m² Floor Area (MOL) |182  m² Freehold Section (MOL) \r\nLot4: 4 Bedrooms (including 2 Ensuites) | 171 m² Floor Area (MOL) |200  m² Freehold Section (MOL) \r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n• Freehold, freestanding, double level with single internal garage .\r\n• Each offers 4 spacious bedrooms, including 2 private ensuites 3 bathrooms— providing exceptional comfort and convenience for modern family living.\r\n• Upon entry, you are welcomed into a separate lounge that provides privacy for formal gatherings and serves as an inviting retreat for intimate family moments.\r\n• The open-plan dining and kitchen area are beautifully designed with style and space in mind — ideal for entertaining or relaxed everyday living.\r\n• Step outside to a sun-soaked deck, north facing aspect with abundant natural light, perfectly positioned to capture all day sunlight — great for entertaining family and friends. The fully fenced backyard is low-maintenance and provides a safe, secure space for kids to play.\r\n• Modern, fully equipped kitchen featuring Bosch appliances and a powerful Fotile rangehood — designed to eliminate cooking fumes for a clean, fresh cooking environment.\r\n• This home also includes a wide range of high-spec chattels, such as 3 heat pumps, LED mirrors, double-glazed windows, underground heating for upstairs bathrooms , build-in sound system and an advanced alarm system — offering both comfort and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nZoned for Top Schools, all within walking distance\r\n• Pigeon Mountain School\r\n• Bucklands Beach Intermediate\r\n• Macleans College\r\nFamilies will appreciate being in one of East Auckland’s most sought-after school zones.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location:\r\nLocated in the prestigious Half Moon Bay, you’ll enjoy a vibrant coastal lifestyle close to the stunning Half Moon Bay Marina. A short drive connects you to a wide selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, and ferry services to the Auckland CBD. Whether it's sailing at the local yacht club or enjoying the scenic waterfront, this location truly offers convenience and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss your chance to move into one of East Auckland’s most desirable suburbs — with top-tier education & coastal living, Call now to book a private viewing or visit us at the next open home. You won’t be disappointed!\r\n\r\n\r\nNote: While care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, no responsibility is accepted for the accuracy of the whole or any part thereof and interested persons are advised to make their own enquiries and satisfy themselves in all respects.",
